    "name": "Cosmic Coop",
    "steam_appid": 2497070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b06a9d1807d943bf393c085a3a765fc2.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash landing on a mysterious planet, you awaken to find yourself far from home and surrounded by vibrant, strange wildlife. With nothing but a rickety farmhouse and a handful of clues, it\u2019s up to you to rebuild, explore, and discover the secrets of this cosmic world. Befriend the quirky inhabitants, uncover the truth behind your arrival, and help the Critterlings thrive as you create a new life among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3d1e7d8d38a433774a690b1dd54fdf67.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Coop</strong> is a cozy, creature-collection farming game where you\u2019re free to create your own adventure at your own pace. Whether you love designing the perfect farm, meeting quirky villagers, or befriending magical creatures, every day offers new surprises and ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a variety of cute hairstyles and fun outfits. Make your farmer unique and show off your style as you explore and interact with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops, arrange cozy decorations, and craft useful items to build a farm that feels like home. Every part of your land is customizable\u2014shape it to match your personality or try new themes for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/5b7ba2e4a6a434d0f6b1f22f3f7835d9.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious eggs scattered across the land and hatch them into adorable Critterlings. Each egg holds a surprise, and you never know which rare or playful creature you might get next! Breed your favorites and expand your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a bustling village filled with unique NPCs, each with their own personalities and stories. Build friendships, complete fun quests,  and experience seasonal changes as you become a part of the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from farming to explore the sandy beaches around your farm. Find treasures, fish, or simply enjoy the beautiful views.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/328633e89b78addb1625163ea9204a03.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Critterlings: playful, pi\u00f1ata-like creatures, each with unique personalities, favorite treats, and special item drops. Some are shy, others mischievous, and every Critterling brings something new to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, care for, and collect dozens of Critterlings\u2014each with their own look and quirks. Decorate your land to make them feel at home, and unlock special interactions as your collection grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/eede6c54f41a0cb7437892c1a06350bf.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the magical soundtrack by <strong>Wood Simon</strong> transport you to a cozy new world. Each season and area features its own whimsical music, creating a relaxing, unforgettable vibe for your journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b06a9d1807d943bf393c085a3a765fc2.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash landing on a mysterious planet, you awaken to find yourself far from home and surrounded by vibrant, strange wildlife. With nothing but a rickety farmhouse and a handful of clues, it\u2019s up to you to rebuild, explore, and discover the secrets of this cosmic world. Befriend the quirky inhabitants, uncover the truth behind your arrival, and help the Critterlings thrive as you create a new life among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3d1e7d8d38a433774a690b1dd54fdf67.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Coop</strong> is a cozy, creature-collection farming game where you\u2019re free to create your own adventure at your own pace. Whether you love designing the perfect farm, meeting quirky villagers, or befriending magical creatures, every day offers new surprises and ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/fab231ec8f1bc6ff37c768b4813d9ee9.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a variety of cute hairstyles and fun outfits. Make your farmer unique and show off your style as you explore and interact with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/c218f14405dbf655b7a1c55e825e7609.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops, arrange cozy decorations, and craft useful items to build a farm that feels like home. Every part of your land is customizable\u2014shape it to match your personality or try new themes for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/5b7ba2e4a6a434d0f6b1f22f3f7835d9.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious eggs scattered across the land and hatch them into adorable Critterlings. Each egg holds a surprise, and you never know which rare or playful creature you might get next! Breed your favorites and expand your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/b6d39802f2f10492e97614f1812a1041.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a bustling village filled with unique NPCs, each with their own personalities and stories. Build friendships, complete fun quests,  and experience seasonal changes as you become a part of the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/1feed580864d2df693e481e976937895.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from farming to explore the sandy beaches around your farm. Find treasures, fish, or simply enjoy the beautiful views.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/328633e89b78addb1625163ea9204a03.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Critterlings: playful, pi\u00f1ata-like creatures, each with unique personalities, favorite treats, and special item drops. Some are shy, others mischievous, and every Critterling brings something new to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.poster.avif?t=1754836244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.webm?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/3a20ad81562718db1c6191c598de1cef.mp4?t=1754836244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, care for, and collect dozens of Critterlings\u2014each with their own look and quirks. Decorate your land to make them feel at home, and unlock special interactions as your collection grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497070/extras/eede6c54f41a0cb7437892c1a06350bf.avif?t=1754836244\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the magical soundtrack by <strong>Wood Simon</strong> transport you to a cozy new world. Each season and area features its own whimsical music, creating a relaxing, unforgettable vibe for your journey.</p>",
